              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "39:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi baraakubuuze bati: Ahabw'enki nootsinda? obagire oti: N'ahabw'ebimpuriire. Ku biriija, emitima y'abantu boona eryahwerera, n'emikono ya boona eryahwa amaani, emyoyo ya boona eryagwa enshazi, kandi n'entegye za boona ziryabonda, zibe nk'amaizi. Reeba nibiija, kandi biryahikiirizibwa; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana w'omuntu, hanuura noogira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama arikugamba naagira ati: Rurara, rurara etyarize kandi eyeziibwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.21.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 21:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.21.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " etyaziibwe kwita, yaayezibwa kumurinkana nk'omurabyo. Mbwenu aho nitwija kwogaho, tugir eokushemererwa? Mwana wangye, ogayire enkoni n'ekintu kyona ekyetwa ekiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rurara egyo ehairweyo kwezibwa, ngu ebone kukoresibwa; etyaziibwe, yaayezibwa ngu ebone kuheebwa omwitsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.31.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 31:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mwana w'omuntu, rira oboroogye, ahabw'okuba n'ey'okurwanisa abantu bangye, n'ey'okurwanisa abanyiginya ba Israeli boona; bahairweyo ahari rurara hamwe n'abantu bangye. N'ahabw'ekyo yemaamaate, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahabw'okuba hariho ekigyezo; mbwenu enkoni erikugaya ku eraabe etakiriho, biryaba bita? nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
