                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'ahabw'ekyo, Mwana w'omuntu, hanuura, kandi oteere omu ngaro nooragiira rurara kutema kabiri, eego kashatu, niyo rurara y'okwita abarikwija kwitwa; rurara egyo niyo y'okwita omukuru orikwija kuhutaazibwa obuhuta oburikwta, etaahire omu bishengye byabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngu emitima yaabo ehahaare, baingi bagwe omu marembo gaabo goona. Ayaayaaya! neemurinkana nk'omurabyo, eyeziibwe ahabw'okwita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Temera kimwe aha rubaju rwa buryo n'orwa bumosho, ei obwogi bwawe burikureeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
