        {
          "text": " Omu mukono gwe gwa buryo endagu nizeerera Yeresaalemu kugiteera nibaashamya akanwa nibahiga, nibateera orwari, kugibyaraho ebiti by'okuhiguza amarembo, kurundaho eby'okutemberaho, kandi n'okugyombekaho ebigo by'okugigotesa. ",
