        {
          "text": " Naiwe mwana w'omuntu, hanuura, noogira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba aha Baamoni, n'aha kijumo kyabo; noogira oti: Rurara, rurara esyoirweyo, yaayezibwa kwita, n'okumurinkana nk'omurabyo, ",
