          "text": " (ku barikuba nibakikureebera okworekwa okutari kw'amazima, nibakuragurira ebishuba) ngu oteebwe aha bitsya by'abantu babi, abahutaaziibwe obuhuta oburikwita; abu obunaku bwabo obw'ekifubiro ky'aha muheru buhikire. ",
